WEBVTT

00:00:02.581 --> 00:00:07.154
Choose Go to the start line, and the race opens full screen: your bike, a map, and

00:00:07.154 --> 00:00:09.016
thirty minutes on the clock.

00:00:10.324 --> 00:00:14.709
Along the top: the map and its route, whom you race, your bike, and the clock, out

00:00:14.709 --> 00:00:15.972
of thirty minutes.

00:00:20.647 --> 00:00:25.879
Power is the biggest number. Three hundred and seventy-one watts against a target of

00:00:25.879 --> 00:00:28.235
four eighteen: forty-seven under.

00:00:30.971 --> 00:00:35.825
The interval panel: work, one of eight, twenty-nine seconds left, and what comes

00:00:35.825 --> 00:00:38.916
next. A screen reader hears the time in words.

00:00:41.295 --> 00:00:45.538
Each segment's level goes to the bike as it starts: eight for the warm-up,

00:00:45.538 --> 00:00:48.303
twenty-four for the effort, six to recover.

00:00:51.618 --> 00:00:56.205
The route profile comes from the main branch, copied as it is. The road eases

00:00:56.205 --> 00:01:00.497
towards the world's grade, giving the climb and the metres climbed.

00:01:01.942 --> 00:01:06.696
Speed comes from your power, ten times the cube root of watts over twenty. Its sum

00:01:06.696 --> 00:01:08.851
is the distance you have ridden.

00:01:12.266 --> 00:01:16.587
Lower and Raise send the next level as your own, and switch off while the bike is

00:01:16.587 --> 00:01:17.154
away.

00:01:22.590 --> 00:01:27.551
A phone keeps the world, power and the interval. From a laptop, every panel, the

00:01:27.551 --> 00:01:29.588
bottom row in three columns.

00:01:32.913 --> 00:01:37.828
What the tests prove: eighty-two behaviour specs, the route profile and the speed in

00:01:37.828 --> 00:01:41.287
unit tests, all green, and the first bundle unchanged.

00:01:43.237 --> 00:01:47.840
Telo Ride, from the Telo family, turns a smart bike at home into a game.

00:01:48.185 --> 00:01:52.697
It pairs with the bike over Bluetooth, reads your power and sets resistance for

00:01:52.697 --> 00:01:54.368
every hill and interval.

00:01:54.713 --> 00:01:59.891
Two doors: Race (ride a map against your best-time ghost, bots or people) and

00:01:59.891 --> 00:02:05.339
Classes (ride along to a video, alone or with a group), fed by one progression of

00:02:05.339 --> 00:02:08.329
XP, rider levels, stars and map unlocks.

00:02:08.675 --> 00:02:11.167
A custom workout lives under Profile.
